# Firebase service account key — grants the right to push to every user of
# the app. Lives outside the repo; the server reads it from a mounted file.
**/firebase-service-account.json
**/*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
docker/secrets/*
!docker/secrets/.gitkeep
